  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">India Prosperity Fund programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme focuses on where the UK&#x2019;s expertise and strengths match India&#x2019;s reform priorities and development needs. These include climate and green growth (including working with India on taking a sustainable, low carbon approach to urbanisation) and advocating free and fair trade through work on ease of doing business, skills, and financial services.</narrative>
  </description>
